From 9cb2f02a790aab2d6bcb565d75f07cb4247bb99a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ObeseCatLord <6099645+ObeseCatLord@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 19:57:09 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 34/34] ga2: movie playback (IPU BDEC fields, output DMA probe,
 scratchpad chain/interleave DMA), vblank rebase

- IPU BDEC: DT/DCR/MBI decoded from bits 25/26/27; output FIFO drains only
  when fromIPU DMA is armed; per-opcode stats under GA2_PERF and traces
  under GA2_IPU_TRACE.
- Scratchpad DMA: chain (mode 1) and interleave (mode 2) for toSPR/fromSPR.
  libmpeg's motion compensation fetches reference blocks with chain-mode
  toSPR; dropping them left predicted macroblocks empty (green frames).
- EE scheduler: after a slow stretch, rebase vblank pacing to wall time
  instead of firing vblanks back to back.
- IPU init tests now check a real reset of a busy IPU; GA2_RPC_TRACE.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
